    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-acanthometra-pellucida-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Acanthometra pellucida Schnakenberg wavelength at 206 nm (Holocene, 0 Ma), pass 2 — Model fidelity to source: 88/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 1's Schnakenberg system and k_c formula are unchanged. Pass 2 adds a linear-decay knockout that removes u^2 v without integrating the inhibitor to infinity, and a one-parameter scale estimated off the test gammas. The 206 nm figure is still the length unit. No measured SrSO4 diffusivity enters the kinetics." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-acanthometra-pellucida-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-acanthometra-pellucida-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-acanthometra-pellucida-turing-wavelength-s0-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 8.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-delphi10000-acanthometra-pellucida-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Acanthometra pellucida Schnakenberg wavelength at 206 nm (Holocene, 0 Ma), pass 2 — Morphometric validation: 84/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-27"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "In-sample r = 0.9991, RMSE = 43.30 nm, residual CV = 0.101. Held-out r = 0.9991, p = 0.027, n = 3, RMSE = 6.09 nm. The p-value is weak because n = 3; the RMSE drop is the result that matters. Specimen foreground 0.501 versus simulation 0.352, coherency 0.601 versus 0.843, circularity 0.012 versus 0.014, spine peaks 8 versus Müller's 20, orientation KS = 0.113. Radial-profile r = 0.096, down from 0.548 in pass 1. That miss is why this score is not higher." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/grok-4.7> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/morphometric-validation" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-acanthometra-pellucida-turing-wavelength-s0-measurement-analytical-turing-wavelength-at-gamma-10>,
